title: Teaching Guide for Unit 4: Artificial Intelligence

{


heading: Purpose
    raw-html:<p>This unit introduces several types of AI algorithms: machine learning, generative AI, neural nets, embeddings, and reinforcement learning. The goal is for students to get a taste of the key aspects of several different types of AI and, in several cases, a glimpse into the code underlying they work.</p>
    //raw-html: <div class="btn btn-primary"><a href="http://bjc.link/msfeedback" style="color: #FFF;" title="Submit End-of-Lab or General Feedback" target="_blank">Submit End-of-Lab or General Feedback</a></div>
